OL,3,ARare panto programmes owned by 'Freddie
OL,4,AMercury of his time' sell at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare pair of pantomime programmes
OL,7,Ffrom the private theatre of a man
OL,8,Fdubbed "the Freddie Mercury of his
OL,9,Ftime" have sold at auction for #3,600.
OL,11,FThe 4th Marquess of Anglesey Henry
OL,12,FCyril Paget, also known as the Dancing
OL,13,FMarquess, used his family home Plas
OL,14,FNewydd, on Anglesey, to stage lavish
OL,15,Fproductions free for local people.
OL,17,FHis life was recently turned into a
OL,18,Fbiopic, with Callum Scott Howells
OL,19,Fplaying the aristocrat.
